# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Design source binaries — keep them out of git history
#
# A 53MB Icon.psd was pushed on 15 Aug 2026 and GitHub warned about it (GH001).
# Git stores every version of a binary forever, so one careless commit of a
# layered PSD costs more than the entire rest of this repo, permanently.
#
# What stays tracked in assets/: .ai (true vectors, ~270KB each), .pdf, and the
# web-ready .png/.webp/.svg/.jpg. That is everything the site or a printer
# actually needs.
#
# What is excluded: the editable masters and the redundant archives. Keep those
# in the client's own storage — they are design working files, not source code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.psd
*.zip
*.eps
